1
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:10,340
Strategies you made or added are listed under My Strategies.

2
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:14,360
Make a Copy keeps a second version to experiment with.

3
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:18,770
The copy appears right below.

4
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:21,030
To rename it, right-click it and choose Rename.

5
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:27,420
Type the new name and click Rename.

6
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:32,350
The new name shows in the list. Spaces are left out.

7
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:35,360
Delete removes it.

8
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:40,980
You are asked to confirm, because this cannot be undone.

9
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:43,480
It is gone from My Strategies.

